cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: scHopfield
abstract: >-
  Fit an interpretable dynamical model of gene regulation to single-cell data.
  scHopfield learns a signed gene-gene interaction matrix per cell type from
  expression and RNA velocity, in a Hopfield-like form restricted by a
  prior-knowledge scaffold, and reads an energy landscape, per-cell-type
  attractors, their local stability and in-silico perturbations off the fitted
  vector field.
type: software
authors:
